{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/4b2bcec68605c4ab1ccc2759c38f9967.poster.avif?t=1765629459\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/4b2bcec68605c4ab1ccc2759c38f9967.webm?t=1765629459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/4b2bcec68605c4ab1ccc2759c38f9967.mp4?t=1765629459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Candy Bandits</strong> is a thrilling 3D top-down multiplayer party game where Guardians and Bandits face off in chaotic team battles! Equip a mix of passive and active abilities, collect powerful one-time actions from action boxes and strategize with your teammates to outsmart the competition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your goal?</strong> Collect 30 candies to secure victory or stop the enemy team by catching them\u2014teamwork, quick thinking, and clever tactics are your keys to triumph!&quot;<br><br>Will you be a Guardian, defending the precious candies scattered across different landscapes, or will you embrace the life of a Bandit set on stealing these delicious treasures?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/a3baa892d8cdbb1f09834e617326914d.poster.avif?t=1765629459\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/a3baa892d8cdbb1f09834e617326914d.webm?t=1765629459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/a3baa892d8cdbb1f09834e617326914d.mp4?t=1765629459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Actions:</strong> Grab one of many action boxes scattered around the maps and use the unique effects to your and your teams advantage!<br>Actions vary from simple dashes to more complex team-based actions like laying bombs and blinding your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/f75baa40af6833ceed07829e993afb8c.poster.avif?t=1765629459\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/f75baa40af6833ceed07829e993afb8c.webm?t=1765629459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/f75baa40af6833ceed07829e993afb8c.mp4?t=1765629459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maps:</strong> Explore a beautifully crafted world divided into distinct areas, each brought to life as a unique playable level. Navigate your choices with a specially designed, visually stunning map. Select your battleground, form your crew, and embark on epic candy heists. It's time to unite friends, break down genre boundaries, and embark on a thrilling adventure like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2670810?t=1765629459","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2670810?t=1765629459","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/95f94c2c9a639379acc9af570512dc166e5f6644/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765629459","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/95f94c2c9a639379acc9af570512dc166e5f6644/caps